<title>USA: Central CSD 22, N.M., won by Prudential.</title>
<headline>Central CSD 22, N.M., won by Prudential.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities Inc. said it won $6.200 million of Central CSD 22, N.M., general obligation school building bonds, Series Sept. 15, 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.77 percent.</p>
</text>
